\"quick-search\" action=\"/esearch\">\n\t<input class=\"quick-search__field\" type=\"text\" name=\"q\" placeholder=\"Search ESA\">\n\t<button class=\"quick-search__submit\" type=\"submit\"><i class=\"far fa-arrow-right\"></i></button>\n</form>\n\t\n\t\n\t<script>\ntry {\tiniframe = window.self !== window.top;} catch (e) {\tiniframe = true;}if (!iniframe) {theme = 'exploring-discovering';\n$.get('/var/esa/storage/menu_overlay.html', for_overlay_menu);}</script>\n\n<section id=\"overlay-menu\"></section>\n\t\n\n\n\t\t<script>\n$.post(\n\t'/ezjscore/call', \n\t\"ezjscServer_function_arguments=esaux::viewsincr::523978\", \n\tfunction(data) { \n\t\t$(document).ready(function() {\t\t\t$('#viewcount').text(data)\n\t\t})\n\t})\n</script>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t  \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"feature feature--article\">\n\t<a href=\"/ESA_Multimedia/Images/2026/07/Key_visual_of_Expedition_Sound_an_ESA_Space_Science_podcast_series\" class=\"popup\">\n\t\t<img class=\"image-bg stellar\" src=\"/var/esa/storage/images/esa_multimedia/images/2026/07/key_visual_of_expedition_sound_an_esa_space_science_podcast_series/27380753-1-eng-GB/Key_visual_of_Expedition_Sound_an_ESA_Space_Science_podcast_series_pillars.png\" alt=\"Key visual of Expedition Sound, an ESA Space Science podcast series\" data-stellar-ratio=\"0.7\" data-stellar-vertical-offset=\"60\">\n\t</a>\n\t</section>\n\t\n\n<article class=\"article exploring-discovering\">\n\n<header class=\"entry article__block\">\n\t<span class=\"pillar article__item\">Science & Exploration</span>\n\t<h1 class=\"heading heading--main article__item\">Expedition Sound podcast series</h1>\n\t<div class=\"meta article__item\">\n\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>16/07/2026</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span><span id=\"viewcount\">1024</span><small> views</small></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><span id=\"ezsr_total_27380198\">32</span><small> likes</small></span>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs article__block article__item\">\n<a class=\"breadcrumbs__entry\" href=\"/\">ESA</a> /\t\t\t<a class=\"breadcrumbs__entry\" href=\"/Science_Exploration\">Science & Exploration</a> /\t\t\t<a class=\"breadcrumbs__entry\" href=\"/Science_Exploration/Space_Science\">Space Science</a></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"abstract article__block article__item\">\n\t<p>Expedition Sound is a podcast series by the European Space Agency (ESA) in which you’re invited to explore the Universe through your ears. Guided by sonifications – the translation of data into sound – host Zsófi Szalavári travels from our Sun out into the depths of space to uncover what the space telescopes of ESA’s science missions teach us about the Universe.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"article__block\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Each episode stops at a different destination along the way, where Zsófi is joined by ESA scientists, astronomers and sonification experts, to learn about the science that is hidden in the data that our space missions send back to us.</p><p>At the heart of the podcast is the idea that sound can make astronomy more accessible. So, alongside the science, you can also hear from vision impaired astronomers, for whom listening opens an especially meaningful door into space exploration.</p><p>You can listen to Expedition Sound on all major podcast platforms including <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/nl/podcast/esaspacewonders/id1567538653?l=en\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Podcasts</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/2QuC5BQqz0Uf9M2tZtorLd\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>, <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/pw/pbblog-vkkym-aad7e6\" target=\"_blank\">Podbean</a>, <a href=\"https://music.amazon.com/podcasts/6a8fa60a-fbbc-47b5-8c50-3e2fffede980\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon Music</a>, and <a href=\"https://pod.link/aHR0cHM6Ly9mZWVkLnBvZGJlYW4uY29tL0VTQVNwYWNlV29uZGVycy9mZWVkLnhtbA\" target=\"_blank\">more</a>.</p>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"article__block\">\n\t\t\t\t<a name=\"eztoc27380113_0_1\" id=\"eztoc27380113_0_1\"></a><h3>Episode 1 – Our Sun, Solar Orbiter, and listening to solar fireworks</h3><p>Guided by a sonification created with data from&nbsp;the ESA-led&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Solar_Orbiter\" target=\"_blank\">Solar Orbiter</a> mission, we explore some of the mysteries of our Sun. We talk to ESA project scientist Miho Janvier about how Solar Orbiter is studying these mysteries and hear from blind astronomer and science communicator Nic Bonne how sound can make astronomy more accessible.</p><iframe title=\"ESA Explores\" allowtransparency=\"true\" height=\"150\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border: none; min-width: min(100%, 430px);height:150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" data-name=\"pb-iframe-player\" src=\"https://www.podbean.com/player-v2/?i=y5eib-1b081d3-pb&from=pb6admin&share=1&download=1&rtl=0&fonts=Arial&skin=1b1b1b&font-color=auto&logo_link=episode_page&btn-skin=8bbb4e\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\t</div>\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article__block\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article__video\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/ESA_Multimedia/Videos/2026/07/Our_Sun_Solar_Orbiter_and_listening_to_solar_fireworks_Expedition_Sound_episode_1\" class=\"popup\">\n\t\t<div class=\"video__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\n   <img class=\"play-button\" src=\"/extension/pillars/design/pillars/images/play-button.svg\" alt=\"Play\">\n   <div class=\"dimmer\"></div>\n   <img class=\"image-bg\" src=\"/var/esa/storage/images/esa_multimedia/videos/2026/07/our_sun_solar_orbiter_and_listening_to_solar_fireworks_expedition_sound_episode_1/27380020-1-eng-GB/Our_Sun_Solar_Orbiter_and_listening_to_solar_fireworks_Expedition_Sound_episode_1_pillars.png\" alt=\"$video.data_map.short_description.content\">\n\n \n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"video__caption\">\n\t\t\tOur Sun, Solar Orbiter, and listening to solar fireworks – Expedition Sound episode 1 \n\t\t\t<br><a href=\"/ESA_Multimedia/Videos/2026/07/Our_Sun_Solar_Orbiter_and_listening_to_solar_fireworks_Expedition_Sound_episode_1\" class=\"access-the-video popup\">Access the video</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t<p><i>Related links:</i></p>\n<ul>\n\n<li><i><a href=\"https://www.esa.int/Solar_Orbiter\">Solar Orbiter minisite</a></i></li>\n\n<li><i><a href=\"https://www.esa.int/Smile\">Smile minisite</a></i></li>\n\n<li><i><a href=\"https://www.esa.int/ESA_Multimedia/Videos/2024/12/See_and_hear_three_years_of_solar_fireworks\">Sonification of episode 1</a></i></li>\n\n<li><i><a href=\"https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/What_are_solar_flares\">What are solar flares?</a></i></li>\n\n<li><i><a href=\"https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/The_solar_cycle_a_heartbeat_of_stellar_energy\">The solar cycle, a heartbeat of stellar energy</a></i></li>\n\n<li><i><a href=\"https://www.esa.int/ESA_Multimedia/Videos/2025/03/Solar_Orbiter_spots_a_solar_flare\">Solar Orbiter spots a solar flare</a></i></li>\n\n</ul>\n\t</div>\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"article__block\">\n\t\t\t\t<a name=\"eztoc27380131_0_1\" id=\"eztoc27380131_0_1\"></a><h3>Episode 2 – The Solar System, BepiColombo, and flying towards Mercury</h3><p><i>Expected on 30 July 2026</i></p>\t</div>\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"article__block\">\n\t\t\t\t<a name=\"eztoc27380140_0_1\" id=\"eztoc27380140_0_1\"></a><h3>Episode 3 – Our Milky Way galaxy, Gaia and Plato, and hearing stars wobble</h3><p><i>Expected on 13 August 2026</i></p>\t</div>\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"article__block\">\n\t\t\t\t<a name=\"eztoc27380149_0_1\" id=\"eztoc27380149_0_1\"></a><h3>Episode 4 – The depths of space, Euclid, and the mysterious effects of gravity</h3><p><i>Expected on 27 August 2026</i></p>\t</div>\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n    \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div class=\"share button-group article__block article__item\">\n\n<button id=\"ezsr_27380198_5_5\" class=\"btn ezsr-star-rating-enabled\" title=\"Like\">Like</button>\n<p id=\"ezsr_just_rated_27380198\" class=\"ezsr-just-rated hide\">Thank you for liking</p>\n<p id=\"ezsr_has_rated_27380198\" class=\"ezsr-has-rated hide\">You have already liked this page, you can only like it once!</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"a2a_kit a2a_kit_size_32 a2a_default_style\">\n\t<a class=\"a2a_button_x\"></a>\n\t<a class=\"a2a_button_facebook\"></a>\n\t<a class=\"a2a_button_copy_link\"></a>\n\t<a class=\"a2a_dd\" href=https://www.addtoany.com/share></a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\n \n\t<section id=\"footer\">\n\n<span class=\"footer__signature\">European Space Agency</span>\n\n<div class=\"footer-nav\">\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/Services/Frequently_asked_questions\">FAQ</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/Services/Contacts\">Contacts</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/Services/Terms_and_conditions\">Terms and conditions</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/Services/Privacy_notice\">Privacy notice</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/About_Us/Careers_at_ESA\">Careers at ESA</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/Services/Email_updates\">Subscribe </a>\n\t\t\t\t\n</div>\n<div class=\"social-media-links\">\n\t<a h